            <title>[IGNITE-4954] Timeout in ignite-cassandra SessionPool is not configurable</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4954</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Cassandra cache store implementation uses &lt;tt&gt;SessionPool&lt;/tt&gt; class which kills idle sessions after 5 minutes. Need to make this timeout configurable.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
